      #4 Q-00004 r0 cur=1 PENDING_APPROVAL total=59000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:PENDING"]
    [MM quote-edit rate=50000] success: Quote saved.
      #4 Q-00004 r0 cur=1 PENDING_APPROVAL total=590000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:PENDING"]
    [MM2 approve step 2] success: All approvals complete — quote approved and ready to send.
      FINAL: #4 Q-00004 r0 cur=1 APPROVED total=590000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:APPROVED"] — needs BM for >=1,00,000? rule matches

