=== D. level 1 REJECTS, level 2 then approves the remaining step ===
    [MM -> PENDING_APPROVAL] success: Submitted for approval — 2 step(s). Now with p_mm2 Probe (Marketing Manager).
      #6 Q-00006 r0 cur=1 PENDING_APPROVAL total=590000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:PENDING","L2:BRANCH_MANAGER:PENDING"]
    [MM2 reject step 4] success: Rejected. The quote now shows as rejected by you, with your comment.
      #6 Q-00006 r0 cur=1 REJECTED total=590000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:REJECTED","L2:BRANCH_MANAGER:PENDING"]
    [BM approve step 5] success: All approvals complete — quote approved and ready to send.
      FINAL: #6 Q-00006 r0 cur=1 APPROVED total=590000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:REJECTED","L2:BRANCH_MANAGER:APPROVED"]

=== E. re-submit after rejection: what happens to the rejected step record ===
    [MM -> PENDING_APPROVAL] success: Submitted for approval — 1 step(s). Now with p_mm2 Probe (Marketing Manager).
      #7 Q-00007 r0 cur=1 PENDING_APPROVAL total=59000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:PENDING"]
    [MM2 reject step 6] success: Rejected. The quote now shows as rejected by you, with your comment.
    [MM -> PENDING_APPROVAL] success: Submitted for approval — 1 step(s). Now with p_mm2 Probe (Marketing Manager).
      #7 Q-00007 r0 cur=1 PENDING_APPROVAL total=59000 contract=- steps=["L1:user3:PENDING"]
      before: [{"id":6,"level":1,"status":"REJECTED","acted_by":"p_mm2 Probe","remarks":"Wrong scope"}]
      after : [{"id":7,"level":1,"status":"PENDING","acted_by":"","remarks":""}]
      rejection still in quote history? ["Submitted for approval","Rejected by p_mm2 Probe \u2014 Wrong scope","Submitted for approval"]

=== F. self-approval through the chain: generic step (no rule matches), creator approves own quote ===
    [MM -> PENDING_APPROVAL] success: Submitted for approval — 1 step(s). Now with admin (Admin (legacy)), p_mm Probe (Marketing Manager), p_mm2 Probe (Marketing Manager).
      #8 Q-00008 r0 cur=1 PENDING_APPROVAL total=59000 contract=- steps=["L1:any:PENDING"]
    [MM approve step 8] success: All approvals complete — quote approved and ready to send.
